 const notes=[
 ["Clinical history & examination","Take presenting complaint, HPI, past and medication history, allergy, family/social history and review of systems. Examine general condition, hydration, pallor, jaundice, cyanosis, edema and vital signs.","मुख्य समस्या, हालको रोग, पुराना रोग/औषधि/एलर्जी, परिवार तथा सामाजिक इतिहास लिनुहोस्। सामान्य अवस्था, पानीको कमी, फिक्कापन, जन्डिस, नीलोपन, सुन्निनु र vital signs जाँच्नुहोस्।"],
 ["Vital signs","Measure temperature, pulse, respiratory rate and blood pressure using correct technique; assess SpO₂ when indicated. Repeat unexpected readings.","तापक्रम, नाडी, श्वासदर र रक्तचाप सही विधिले नाप्नुहोस्। आवश्यकताअनुसार SpO₂ जाँच्नुहोस् र असामान्य नतिजा पुनः मापन गर्नुहोस्।"],
 ["ABCDE emergency approach","Airway, Breathing, Circulation, Disability, Exposure. Call for help, treat life-threatening problems first, monitor and arrange referral.","Airway, Breathing, Circulation, Disability, Exposure क्रम पालना गर्नुहोस्। सहयोग बोलाउनुहोस्, ज्यान जोखिमका समस्या पहिले सम्हाल्नुहोस् र referral मिलाउनुहोस्।"],
 ["Shock","Shock is inadequate tissue perfusion. Warning signs include altered consciousness, cool clammy skin, weak rapid pulse and hypotension (may be late).","Shock भनेको तन्तुमा पर्याप्त रक्तप्रवाह नपुग्नु हो। चेतना बदलिनु, चिसो पसिनायुक्त छाला, कमजोर छिटो नाडी र रक्तचाप घट्नु संकेत हुन्।"],
 ["Diabetes & hypoglycaemia","Diabetes involves persistent hyperglycaemia. In a conscious person who can swallow safely, suspected hypoglycaemia requires fast-acting oral glucose and reassessment per protocol.","मधुमेहमा glucose लगातार बढ्छ। होसमा र सुरक्षित निल्न सक्ने hypoglycaemia बिरामीलाई protocol अनुसार छिटो असर गर्ने मुखबाट glucose दिई पुनः जाँच्नुहोस्।"],
 ["Hypertension","Confirm elevated BP with proper repeated measurements and follow current national guidance. Do not stop prescribed medicine because of one normal reading.","उच्च BP सही विधिले पटकपटक मापन गरी पुष्टि गर्नुहोस्। एकपटक सामान्य आएको आधारमा निर्धारित औषधि आफैँ नरोकिनुहोस्।"],
 ["Respiratory emergencies","Severe breathlessness, cyanosis, exhaustion, low oxygen saturation or altered consciousness are danger signs; assess ABC and arrange urgent care.","गम्भीर सास कष्ट, नीलोपन, थकान, oxygen कम वा चेतना परिवर्तन खतरा संकेत हुन्; ABC जाँचेर तुरुन्त उपचार/रेफरल गर्नुहोस्।"],
 ["Maternal danger signs","Heavy bleeding, severe headache/visual symptoms, convulsions, severe abdominal pain, fever or reduced fetal movement need urgent assessment.","धेरै रक्तस्राव, कडा टाउको दुखाइ/दृष्टि समस्या, दौरा, कडा पेट दुखाइ, ज्वरो वा बच्चा कम चल्नुमा तुरुन्त जाँच चाहिन्छ।"],
 ["Newborn danger signs","Poor feeding, convulsions, fast/difficult breathing, fever or low temperature, reduced movement and severe jaundice require urgent referral.","दूध नखाने, दौरा, छिटो/गाह्रो श्वास, ज्वरो/तापक्रम कम, चाल कम वा गम्भीर जन्डिसमा तुरुन्त referral गर्नुहोस्।"],
 ["Infection prevention","Standard precautions for every patient: hand hygiene, appropriate PPE, safe injection, sharps safety, cleaning and correct equipment reprocessing.","हरेक बिरामीमा हात सफाइ, उचित PPE, सुरक्षित injection, sharps सुरक्षा, सफाइ र उपकरणको सही प्रशोधन अपनाउनुहोस्।"],
 ["Epidemiology","Incidence = new cases in a defined population/time. Prevalence = all existing cases at a point or over a period.","Incidence = निश्चित समयका नयाँ केस। Prevalence = कुनै समय/अवधिमा रहेका सबै केस।"],
 ["Rational medicine use","Check indication, patient factors, dose, route, duration, contraindications, interactions and allergy. Avoid unnecessary antibiotics.","औषधिको कारण, बिरामीको अवस्था, मात्रा, मार्ग, अवधि, निषेध, interaction र एलर्जी जाँच्नुहोस्। अनावश्यक antibiotic नदिनुहोस्।"]
 ];
 notes.push(...[["Community Health & PHC","Primary health care is accessible, community-based and comprehensive. Core principles include equity, community participation, intersectoral coordination and appropriate technology.","PHC: पहुँच, समुदाय सहभागिता, समानता, अन्तरक्षेत्रीय सहकार्य र उपयुक्त प्रविधि।"],["Epidemiology & prevention","Incidence counts new cases; prevalence counts all existing cases. Primary prevention prevents onset, secondary detects early, tertiary limits disability.","Incidence नयाँ केस; prevalence सबै रहेका केस। Primary रोकथाम, secondary early detection, tertiary जटिलता/अपाङ्गता घटाउने।"],["Family health & MCH","ANC includes risk assessment, screening, counselling and preventive care. Maternal danger signs include heavy bleeding, convulsions, severe headache/visual symptoms and reduced fetal movement.","ANC मा जाँच, screening, counselling र preventive care। धेरै रक्तस्राव, दौरा, दृष्टि समस्या र बच्चा कम चल्नु danger sign।"],["Child health & IMCI","Assess danger signs, breathing, hydration, nutrition, immunisation and feeding. Poor feeding, lethargy, convulsions or difficult breathing require urgent assessment.","बच्चामा danger sign, श्वास, dehydration, पोषण, खोप र feeding जाँच्नुहोस्। दूध नखाने, सुस्त, दौरा वा गाह्रो श्वासमा urgent assessment।"],["General Medicine","Use systematic history, examination and vital signs. Stabilise ABC, identify red flags, monitor and refer according to scope and protocol.","इतिहास, परीक्षण र vital signs व्यवस्थित रूपमा। ABC स्थिर पार्ने, खतरा संकेत पहिचान, monitoring र scope अनुसार referral।"],["General Surgery & first aid","Control severe bleeding with direct pressure; immobilise suspected fractures; cool burns with cool running water; never put objects in a seizure patient's mouth.","रक्तस्रावमा direct pressure, fracture immobilise, burn मा cool running water। दौरा हुँदा मुखमा वस्तु नराख्नुहोस्।"],["Obstetrics & Gynaecology","Postpartum haemorrhage, eclampsia, obstructed labour and sepsis are emergencies. Activate help and urgent referral; follow national protocol.","PPH, eclampsia, obstructed labour र sepsis emergency हुन्। सहयोग बोलाएर protocol अनुसार urgent referral।"],["Pharmacology & pharmacy","Check right patient, medicine, dose, route, time, allergy, contraindication, interaction and documentation. Use antibiotics rationally.","Right patient/drug/dose/route/time, allergy, contraindication र documentation जाँच। Antibiotic rational use।"],["Clinical Pathology","CBC commonly uses EDTA blood. Sensitivity detects disease among diseased; specificity identifies negatives among non-diseased. Interpret results with clinical context.","CBC मा EDTA; sensitivity रोग भएकामा positive; specificity रोग नभएकामा negative। रिपोर्ट clinical context सँग बुझ्ने।"],["Nutrition & environmental health","Balanced diet includes adequate energy, protein, fats, vitamins and minerals. Safe water, sanitation, waste management and vector control prevent disease.","सन्तुलित आहारमा energy, protein, fat, vitamin र mineral। सुरक्षित पानी, sanitation, फोहोर व्यवस्थापन र vector control रोग रोक्छ।"]]);

 notes.push(
  ["Cardiovascular system & hypertension","The heart has four chambers. The right side pumps blood to the lungs; the left side pumps oxygenated blood to the body. Persistent high blood pressure increases cardiovascular, renal and stroke risk.","मुटुका चार कोठा हुन्छन्। दायाँ भागले फोक्सोमा र बायाँ भागले शरीरमा रगत पठाउँछ। लगातार उच्च रक्तचापले मुटु, मिर्गौला र stroke को जोखिम बढाउँछ।"],
  ["Respiratory system & asthma","Air travels through the upper airway, trachea and bronchi to the alveoli, where gas exchange occurs. Severe asthma with exhaustion, cyanosis, silent chest or poor response is an emergency.","हावा airway, trachea र bronchi हुँदै alveoli पुग्छ; त्यहाँ gas exchange हुन्छ। दममा अत्यधिक थकान, नीलोपन, silent chest वा उपचारले सुधार नहुनु emergency हो।"],
  ["Endocrine system & diabetes","Insulin is produced by pancreatic beta cells and lowers blood glucose. Hypoglycaemia may cause sweating, tremor, hunger, confusion or unconsciousness; treat according to consciousness and swallowing safety.","Insulin pancreas का beta cell बाट निस्कन्छ र glucose घटाउँछ। कम glucose हुँदा पसिना, कम्पन, भोक, अन्योल वा बेहोसी हुन सक्छ; होस र निल्न सक्ने अवस्थाअनुसार protocol पालना गर्नुहोस्।"],
  ["Renal system & urine examination","The nephron is the functional unit of the kidney. Urine assessment may include appearance, dipstick and microscopy; collect a clean specimen and interpret findings with symptoms and clinical context.","Nephron मिर्गौलाको functional unit हो। पिसाबको appearance, dipstick र microscopy जाँच हुन सक्छ; सफा नमुना सङ्कलन गरी लक्षणसँग मिलाएर बुझ्नुहोस्।"],
  ["Pharmacy calculations & safe dispensing","Convert units before calculating: 1 g = 1,000 mg and 1 mg = 1,000 micrograms. Check the prescription, calculation, patient, medicine, dose, route and label; clarify any ambiguity before dispensing.","गणनाअघि unit मिलाउनुहोस्: १ g = १,००० mg र १ mg = १,००० microgram। prescription, गणना, बिरामी, औषधि, मात्रा, मार्ग र label जाँच्नुहोस्; अस्पष्ट भए पुष्टि नगरी नदिनुहोस्।"],
  ["Specimen collection & laboratory quality","Use correct patient identification, specimen type, container, timing and labelling. Prevent contamination, transport promptly and follow biosafety precautions; an unsuitable specimen can produce misleading results.","बिरामी पहिचान, नमुनाको प्रकार, कन्टेनर, समय र label सही राख्नुहोस्। contamination रोक्नुहोस्, छिटो पठाउनुहोस् र biosafety अपनाउनुहोस्; गलत नमुनाले गलत नतिजा दिन सक्छ।"]
 );
